WEBVTT

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:21.890
Mister!

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:24.480
Take good care of Chiko, Ken!

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:34.070
Mister!

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.520
Mister!  He just...

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.660
Relax.  He planned to do that.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:49.700
That's the fifth time he's died.  The boss has a bad habit of shocking people.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:54.130
But he jumped from so high up.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.820
He does this for fun, right?

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:02.400
Come on.  If we don't hurry and get out of here, we'll die before we see him again.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.470
Ready to go?

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:04.180
Yes.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.850
It's OK this way, Boss.

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.230
I have to go to him.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:34.630
Damn, how many bombs did she plant?  That bitch.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.220
This is horrible...

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.500
We don't have time to worry about them.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.720
Come, let's get a move on.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.710
What's going on with this thing?

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.260
Ken-niichan!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:02.190
This is just like steering a boat.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.510
Ken-niichan, that was amazing!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.550
It looks like we may pull this off yet.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.010
I'll keep watch from here.  You go find us some parachutes.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.500
They should be around here somewhere.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.820
Akine-san...

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:45.160
What do you think I'm paying you all these consulting fees for?

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.970
My apologies.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:51.490
But I did find Tome-kun and Miss Koito with my own hands.

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.830
Detective...

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:57.340
Isn't it inappropriate for you to downplay the importance of the heiress, the young lady Chizuko?

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.340
Ah-Ah...

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.490
But it's just as I told the police detective.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:06.480
When I came to, I was just there with no idea of what was what.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.390
God forbid if something horrible were to happen to that child...

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.900
If only she were to be killed now...

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.210
Madam!

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:28.030
Please trust me to handle it from here.  You should go rest.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.210
We're relying on you, Inspector Kawada.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:31.850
Much obliged.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.990
Well now, can I hear your version of the story?

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.280
I'm happy to tell you, but...

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.470
When I woke up, I couldn't move my body.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.050
I had to rely on Mr. Akine to get me out of there.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.310
And do you remember how you got that way?

00:04:56.030 --> 00:05:00.000
If she keeps on eating these, she'll eventually die of poison.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.820
And, as the Madam told you, day after day you unwittingly gave these to her.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:07.120
If things go bad, you'll be considered an accomplice.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.320
Did you recall something?

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.390
No.

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:13.260
Nothing.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.830
I see.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.010
Not here.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.480
I'll just have to do what I can.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.490
How's the Madam doing?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:01.510
I'm more worried about the young lady Chizuko than about her.

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:05.760
Seriously.  The police and the detective haven't been any help at all.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.270
They're all incompetent.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.130
Seriously.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.260
I'm the only one who can protect her.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.850
It's Tome.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:14.890
Come in.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.880
Pardon my intrusion.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:24.400
What is it?

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.420
Those are for Chizuko's health.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:31.800
No, ma'am.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:32.910
They're poison.

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:44.420
Poison that I've been putting bit by bit into her food every day because you told me it was for her health.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.920
My, that's terrible.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.180
You've been serving Chizuko poison?

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:53.180
According to your instructions.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:58.170
Here I go out of my way to special order that medicine, only to have you secretly switch it on me.

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:00.810
Who is it that prepares her meals, I wonder.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.130
Ma'am!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.950
It's quite horrible that you'd attempt to kill the heiress.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.070
What a terrible servant.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.990
So, will you be calling the police then?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.730
Why would I go to that much trouble?

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:19.100
I'm just going to discharge you, effective immediately.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.970
I might even add a little something to your wages up until today.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.800
You could maybe start a business somewhere out in the countryside.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:35.120
Do you think you can find a chief housekeeper who's as good as I am?

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:40.370
The young lady is quite delicate.  She can detect even the slightest variation in taste.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:41.970
Unlike you, apparently.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.400
If you're discharging me, then I guess I'll go right to the police.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:11.170
If you let me stay here, I'll whittle away your life piece by piece.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.790
What is it you wish?

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:25.520
Please provide me with a house for the young lady.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.340
And then assign me to be with her.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.520
I'll bear the responsibility of protecting her.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:42.160
I did it.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.160
Young lady...

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:51.550
I hope you're safe.

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:06.600
Parachutes!

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.450
Damn it!  The parachutes!

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:28.960
What?

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.710
It'll only turn to the left?!

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.200
I beg you, don't crash into the city.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.490
Ken-niichan, I'm sorry.  The parachutes...

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.180
I figured that.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:00.490
I just need to think of a way to get us out of here.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.870
Calm down!  Don't panic!

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:16.760
Calm down!  Please take shelter inside a building!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.890
In any case, first you need to clear this away.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:34.920
Hey, you there!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:38.360
You can't just leave your car there; it's in the way.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.530
Oh, excuse me.  I'm Akechi.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.810
Oh, the detective?

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:44.290
My apologies!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.990
You need to evacuate quickly.  We don't know when it'll crash.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:49.510
C-Certainly.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:51.060
Ah, what about you?!

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:54.920
I'm going to get things ready in case it crashes into the sea.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.620
Oh!  It's turned towards the sea somehow.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.780
We're turning back again.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.390
What if we crash into the city?

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:15.400
Don't worry.  We can land safely in the water if we can hold it for two more laps.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.310
This was definitely...

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.550
This is bad.

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:40.310
Hey, we're still up in the air.

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.300
Are we crashing?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.410
They were just put to sleep!

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.500
Now we'll have to land on the water no matter what.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.020
Failure isn't an option.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.150
Shit!

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:03.200
Chiko!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.320
I'm fine.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.080
Ken-niichan!

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.430
Hang on tight!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:24.880
What's this?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:53.960
We made it!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.590
We're going to crash right into the sea.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:06.830
It's coming back again!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:07.760
Oh crap.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.770
That thing's filled with passengers!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.770
I need all of you to help.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.480
What should we do?

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.490
Listen up!  Everyone available needs to take out their boats!

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.030
You guys gather some blankets!

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:26.530
Yes, sir!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.780
Call for ambulances, too!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.230
We're going down.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:37.000
H-Hey!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:42.000
If I let you go, you'll run off somewhere like the Boss.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:48.010
All right.  Then hold on tight so I don't go anywhere!

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.010
OK.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.040
Come on, grab my hand.

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:35.010
They couldn't still be...

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.130
You all right?

00:14:59.130 --> 00:14:59.700
Yeah.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.350
I think we can make it out.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:03.360
Let's go before she sinks.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.030
OK!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.770
Chizuko-kun, are you OK?

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:04.770
Akechi-san?

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:06.790
Thank goodness.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.350
I...

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:45.440
Twenty Faces didn't tell me anything.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.290
That road that he's walking down...

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.950
I'm going to walk down it without him.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.010
Thank you so much!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.710
I'll go to the hospital at once.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.470
Oh?  Oh dear.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:07.800
I can't thank you enough.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:10.530
Yes.  I'll stop by early in the morning.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:11.700
Thank you.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.370
Please take care of the young lady tonight then.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.060
Thank you so very much.

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.450
Young lady...

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.730
Wow, is that so?  Mr. Akechi saved her.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.540
That's wonderful.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:34.110
I don't plan to have her return here after she leaves the hospital.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:37.820
Please hurry and provide me with the mansion we spoke about.

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.700
I understand.  I'll give you one.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.190
I see.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:56.590
In the city of Toran.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.570
Something curious happened there.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:04.310
A Japanese person was murdered in the outskirts of Toran.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:08.270
He was a part of some secret research organization during the war.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:12.570
I heard a story that Twenty Faces was connected with the same organization.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:13.880
Twenty Faces was?

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:17.070
They found the remains of a burnt document.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.740
Among the ashes, they were able to make out one piece of information.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.250
A document...

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.490
Yes.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:27.120
We don't know who burned it, but...

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:30.830
I feel that it's a clue that will bring us closer to Twenty Faces.

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.090
What was...

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.670
...written on it?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.220
The fourth state of water.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.010
The fourth state of water?

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:48.720
The truth can take on a form that no one can recognize.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.340
Just like the water there.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.990
If you freeze it, it turns to ice.  If you heat it, it turns to steam.

00:18:53.990 --> 00:19:00.180
People don't hold any doubts about the existence of those three common forms—liquid, solid, and gas.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:04.400
But imagine if there was a fourth form that no one knew about.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:07.700
Do you know something about it?

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.410
I don't know...

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.760
...what it means.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.850
Give our best to the young lady.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.760
Sure.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:33.150
When she leaves the hospital, you'll bring her here one more time so we can see her, won't you?

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.920
Well, we'll see.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.070
OK, I'm off.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:46.890
Why did Twenty Faces go after Chizuko-san again?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.860
Say, where's that car going?

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:00.360
Tell us!

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:01.840
We don't know anything.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.130
Please leave now.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.550
Hey, don't be stingy!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:08.430
My, Tome did good.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:11.830
She became the young lady's exclusive guardian and left the mansion.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:14.930
And she's free from that big-mouthed Madam.

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.110
I'm so jealous!

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.350
I won't forgive this.

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:32.660
Young lady!  It's me, Tome!

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:33.870
Tome-san!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.190
No!

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:39.530
You need your rest!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:42.920
Lie down now.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.030
Geez, Tome-san.

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:50.770
I'm fine.  Just some scratches and a sprain.

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:57.110
Thank heavens.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.320
I'm so glad you're not hurt.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:06.780
I'm back now.
